{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02886","headline":"奉和太子纳妃太平公主出降 · 元万顷","name":"奉和太子纳妃太平公主出降","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"象辂初乘鴈，璇宫早结褵。\n离元应春夕，帝子降秋期。\n鸣瑜合清响，冠玉丽穠姿。\n和声跻凤掖，交影步鸾墀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元万顷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02886.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02886","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}